  "text": "Skip to main content\n\nProfile demo\n\nHome\nEdit profile\nVideo instructions\nHelp\nSign in\nSign out\nHelp\n\nUse the following account on this test service:\n\nDemo email\ndemo@example.test\nDemo password\nTest-password-42!\n\nYou can paste both values into the sign-in form. The sign-in page also offers a Show password button.\n\nProfile fields\nWhat to enter\nField\tInstructions\nName\tEnter the name to display.\nEmail\tEnter an address such as name@example.test. The Japanese word for email is メール.\nSaving changes\n\nChoose Review changes, check both values, then choose Confirm and save. Use Back to edit to correct a value without re-entering the other value.\n\nHelp\n\nContact: example@example.test",
